front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-bc377838462a\",\"rationale\":\"Push to the g limit (about -3.5704) and take D to 3.3852, where mass margin is +2.7e-5. Expect a tiny T gain of about 0.005 K.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3852,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5703},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274570,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.08,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the extreme corner of the feasible set; the front's lowest-T point could improve marginally.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-bc377838462a\",\"rationale\":\"Set D=3.3852 with gamma -3.568, well inside the g limit, so this is a safe low-T-end point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3852,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.568},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274510,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.11,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Robust near-limit point; separates the D effect from the gamma effect.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":102169,"type":"result","duration_ms":140837,"uuid":"e3c6bda9-8fab-4427-9b71-56236e606e41","ttft_stream_ms":3190,"time_to_request_ms":139,"first_content_frame_ms":3191,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
